ts":2,"created_at":"2025-03-03T23:00:22Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T18:09:24Z","closed_at":"2025-03-05T18:08:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103531","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103531","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103531.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103531.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-05T18:08:45Z"},"body":"Clustered performs the following shadow rendering steps\r\n\r\n1. Process objects [0; 10) for cascade 0.\r\n2. Process objects [10; 30) for cascade 1.\r\n3. Process objects [30; 100) for cascade 2.\r\n4. Upload objects [0; 100) to GPU.\r\n5. Draw all cascades.\r\n\r\nMobile was supposed to be doing the same, but instead was doing:\r\n\r\n1. Process objects [0; 10) for cascade 0.\r\n2. Upload objects [0; 10) to GPU.\r\n3. Process objects [10; 30) for cascade 1.\r\n4. Upload objects [0; 30) to GPU.\r\n5. Process objects [30; 100) for cascade 2.\r\n6. Upload objects [0; 100) to GPU.\r\n7. Draw all cascades.\r\n\r\nThat is, always reuploaded everything from scratch. Therefore it pointlessly (and with geometric growth) wasted BW.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://ap